    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in <strong>Driving Is Hard</strong>! Drive a bathtub on wheels through steep, unforgiving terrain where every mistake costs you progress. Master tough physics-based gameplay, sharpen your patience, and uncover Jeff\u2019s journey of self-doubt, family struggles, and emotional growth as he finds strength, self-acceptance, and hope for a brighter future. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/1aa1cb5c00e0c09277e5d61bff34d39d.poster.avif?t=1755091142\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/1aa1cb5c00e0c09277e5d61bff34d39d.webm?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/1aa1cb5c00e0c09277e5d61bff34d39d.mp4?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive a Bathtub</strong>: Navigate Jeff in a physics-based bathtub on wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Your Experience</strong>: Easy Mode for a fun, relaxed time or Hard Mode for the original challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 7 Worlds</strong>: Each with unique challenges and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play, Hard to Master: </strong>Simple controls, challenging mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Journey: </strong>Jeff faces his father\u2019s expectations and finds his own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Bathtub</strong>: Unlock and use different car skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Soaps</strong>: Find 21 soaps as you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This difficult game tests your patience\u2014falling is part of the challenge.\u00a0Will you rise or quit when it gets tough?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/cf7a8c69af4838936ed5f611a1934114.poster.avif?t=1755091142\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/cf7a8c69af4838936ed5f611a1934114.webm?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/cf7a8c69af4838936ed5f611a1934114.mp4?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself in <strong>Driving Is Hard</strong>! Drive a bathtub on wheels through steep, unforgiving terrain where every mistake costs you progress. Master tough physics-based gameplay, sharpen your patience, and uncover Jeff\u2019s journey of self-doubt, family struggles, and emotional growth as he finds strength, self-acceptance, and hope for a brighter future. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/1aa1cb5c00e0c09277e5d61bff34d39d.poster.avif?t=1755091142\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/1aa1cb5c00e0c09277e5d61bff34d39d.webm?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/1aa1cb5c00e0c09277e5d61bff34d39d.mp4?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drive a Bathtub</strong>: Navigate Jeff in a physics-based bathtub on wheels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Your Experience</strong>: Easy Mode for a fun, relaxed time or Hard Mode for the original challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore 7 Worlds</strong>: Each with unique challenges and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play, Hard to Master: </strong>Simple controls, challenging mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Journey: </strong>Jeff faces his father\u2019s expectations and finds his own path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Bathtub</strong>: Unlock and use different car skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Soaps</strong>: Find 21 soaps as you play.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WARNING!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This difficult game tests your patience\u2014falling is part of the challenge.\u00a0Will you rise or quit when it gets tough?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/cf7a8c69af4838936ed5f611a1934114.poster.avif?t=1755091142\" width=628 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/cf7a8c69af4838936ed5f611a1934114.webm?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3175860/extras/cf7a8c69af4838936ed5f611a1934114.mp4?t=1755091142\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Prove your skills by driving the Bathtub on Wheels! Solve puzzles, collect soap, and dive into Jeff's family drama. Drive, Fall, Learn, Repeat.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cDriving Is Hard is surprisingly fun despite its rage-inducing nature. It\u2019s not unfair like some of its contemporaries, but is a nice yet difficult journey that will keep you trying even after the biggest falls.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Game Grin<br><br>\u201cIt can be annoying, frustrating, rage-inducing, but as far as titles in the microcosm of \u201crage-bait meme games\u201d go, I honestly think that Driving is Hard is the best of the bunch. It features fine production values, but above all else, good controls; the game feels like an actual challenge, and not just a test to see how much you can stomach it.\u201d<br>7/10 \u2013 Way Too Many Games<br><br>\u201cUltimately, Driving is Hard is a game that will test your limits and perhaps make you question why you keep trying. But for those who enjoy that kind of masochistic fun, the rewards, both in terms of gameplay and absurdity, are worth the struggle. So, buckle up (or don\u2019t, it\u2019s hard either way) and give it a go, but be prepared for the ride of your life.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Movies Games and Tech<br>",
